    ['get',"The Jidoor auction house is open now. Bid twice to win an item. Golem costs 20,000 Gil and Zona Seeker 10,000. Each visit puts one random item up: Angel Wings, a talking Chocobo (never sold), {s:Golem}, {s:Zona Seeker} or an Angel Ring. Golem shows up about 1 time in 8, and Zona Seeker 1 in 16 until you own Golem. Leave and come back to reroll."],
